  {
    "url": "https://www.accessibilitychecker.org/guides/wcag-2-2/",
    "title": "WCAG 2.2: A Guide to the Latest Web Accessibility Standard",
    "snippet": "Released as a W3C Recommendation on 5 October 2023, it adds nine new Success Criteria while remaining fully backward-compatible with WCAG 2.1 and WCAG 2.0. WCAG 2.2 (Web Content Accessibility Guidelines) is the latest version of the internationally recognised standards for web accessibility, published by the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C).   Summarize",
    "published": null
