  {
    "url": "https://www.3playmedia.com/blog/the-wcag-2-2-draft-is-here/",
    "title": "WCAG 2.2 is Here: What You Need to Know",
    "snippet": "Mar 21, 2020         WCAG 2.0 & Beyond: Modernizing Web Accessibility [Free eBook]. After years of development, feedback, and several delays, Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) version 2.2 is finally here.With the release of WCAG 2.2 guidelines, W3C additionally updated their web accessibility standard recommendation from 2.1 to the latest version. This means that organizations wishing to conform to the latest WCAG version should begin efforts to incorporate the new success criteria into their web presence.   Summarize",
